$ | $x$ |\n| Salad | $20$ | $25$ | $15$ |\n\nIf a person who preferred pizza is selected at random, the probability that the person paid by card is $\\frac{2}{5}$. What is the value of $x$?\n\n$x =$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229431 1072 #uuid "ed885aa3-dcf9-56ff-9656-bb972c6c1973" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229432 1068 #edb/ref 17592186227070 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229432 1069 "q-305034" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229432 1071 "An electronics shop records whether a buyer’s main purchase was a laptop or a tablet, and how the order was placed. The data is summarized in the table below.\n\n|  | In-store | Online | Phone |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Laptops | $35$ | $20$ | $12$ |\n| Tablets | $21$ | $14$ | $x$ |\n\nIf a person who bought a tablet is selected at random, the probability that the person ordered by online is $\\frac{1}{6}$. What is the value of $x$?\n\n$x =$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229432 1072 #uuid "fb5e67cb-291a-5de4-9909-a9cb20fa1d28" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229433 1068 #edb/ref 17592186227071 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229433 1069 "q-305285" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229433 1071 "![](images/ce/ce8a574c8d7d4f15e1b8a55a4ea25b02f87bdba1e4f8afb0685062786317ab83.png)\n\nThe scatterplot above shows the heights and number of tomatoes harvested by 10 tomato plants. A line of best fit for the data is also shown. Which of the following statements best describes the association between the height and the number of tomatoes harvested?" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229433 1072 #uuid "ec9f3270-c642-5f95-bd94-2ad781cc80fe" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229434 1068 #edb/ref 17592186227077 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229434 1069 "q-305434" 13194139533381 17592186045585 true] [17592186229434 1071 "![](images/a0/a08a7a34f94b305d7f6d1809bd1